  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allow users to post the pictures they take in game on a page that they can personalize. Maybe show off your avatar you put a lot of work into, or share a memory of a new friend you made. User should be able to see the “wall” of all their friends in a streamlined page. It is no secret that a multitude of users have social media accounts that solely exist to accompany their VRChat accounts, so why not “cut out the middleman” and redirect all of that traffic to your service? With a strong and steady growing influx of Oculus Quest users (a device that quite literally requires a FaceBook account), and the obvious reality that VRChat in and of itself is a social game, I’m sure the mass of the player-base would be easily accustomed to the integration of such a system.\nThanks,",
